    "answer": {
      "short": "Mean $=30.4$; median $=31$.",
      "worked": "The plot represents 20 values. Adding the values within each stem gives subtotals of 83, 49, 222 and 254.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{83+49+222+254}{20}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{608}{20}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=30.4\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe 10th and 11th values in order are both 31.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{31+31}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=31\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
